After 11 days of riveting action, the curtain finally came down on the 2026 Commonwealth Games in Glasgow on Sunday. At a glittering closing ceremony at the OVO Hydro, the Commonwealth Games flag and baton were formally handed over to India, which will host the landmark Centenary edition in Ahmedabad in 2030.
